   "Management confirmed Wegovy pill launches in ex-US markets to begin in 2H26 with sufficient supply capacity.",
   "Novo stopped development of the CagriSema coformulation presentation to focus on zenagamtide, which has a similar launch timeline and better dual-chamber device scalability.",
   "Pipeline focus remains on ziltivekimab (CVOT data in 3Q26) and etavopivat (FDA submission in 4Q26) to address concerns regarding the semaglutide patent cliff in 2031/32.",
   "Goldman remains Neutral, citing that current valuations (13.5x 2027 P/E) are fair given the growth trajectory vs. patent expiry risks."
  ],
